  step,dige:0e6c4ededbb6b494
  step=2,desc:stand two clocks and three tanks — K_P and K_Q hear Clock_A — K_R hears Clock_B — poke Clock_A once and run,dige:030e96504aa337fc
    Assertion:a-clock-is-a,sentence:a clock is a compartment like any other — poked it ticks and the tanks joined to it move a round later
  step=3,desc:poke Clock_A three times — run until quiet,dige:a88b0cdbc826db0f
    Assertion:three-pokes-are-three,sentence:three pokes are three ticks — each tank takes its three turns in one move
    Assertion:a-clock-nobody-pokes,sentence:a clock nobody pokes never ticks — the tank joined to it is never visited
  step=4,desc:poke Clock_B once — run until quiet,dige:efa7bf933fdd6a11
    Assertion:poke-the-other-clock,sentence:poke the other clock and only its tank moves — K_P and K_Q stay where they were
